{"product_id":"inside-the-obriens","title":"Inside The O'Briens","description":"\u003cp\u003eJoe O'Brien is a Boston cop whose stamina and methodical mind have seen him through decades policing the city streets.  When he starts making uncharacteristic errors, he attributes them to stress until, finally, he agrees to see a doctor and is handed a terrifying diagnosis:  Huntington's disease.\u003cbr\u003e\nNot only is Joe's life changing beyond recognition, but each of his four grown children has a fifty-fifty chance of inheriting the disease.  Observing her potential future play out in his escalating symptoms, his yoga teacher daughter, Katie wrestles with how to make the most of the here and now, and connect with her dad who is, inside, always an O'Brien.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Inside The O'Briens\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781471142925\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 335\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 24 x 198\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42594308096153,"sku":"8RB9781471142925","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/inside-the-obriens-984569.jpg?v=1694790734","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/inside-the-obriens","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}